From: Peter Jeremy <peter.jeremy () alcatel ! com ! au>
Date: Sun, 05 Nov 2000 21:18:23 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: cvs commit: src/sys/boot/alpha/common main.c src/sys/boot/al
